#etcsl#alt t3101.v4 t3101.v5
#etcsl#altGrpc

@(19 = 19-21) To his right and left he had …… soldiers (?) stationed, five thousand at each side. He placed at their disposal six fattened oxen and  @varh[t3101.v6]{60 } @vart[t3101.v7,t3101.v6]{@varn{1 ms. has instead:} 20 } fattened  @varh[t3101.v8]{sheep } @vart[t3101.v9,t3101.v8]{@varn{1 ms. has instead:} rams } for a meal. He assumed the right to perform my lord's lustration rites.

#etcsl#altGrpo
#etcsl#alt t3101.v6 t3101.v7
#etcsl#alt t3101.v8 t3101.v9
#etcsl#altGrpc

@(22 = 22-25) After a close interrogation at the gate, nobody even bade me enter. When I finally entered, someone brought me a throne with studs plated with red gold and told me: @q[someone,Aradju]{“Sit down!”} I replied: @q[Aradju,someone]{“I am here to present the instructions of my king. Therefore I will not sit down!"”}

@(26 = 26-28) They brought (?) me  @varh[t3101.v10]{two fattened oxen } @vart[t3101.v11,t3101.v10]{@varn{1 ms. has instead:} one fattened ox } and  @varh[t3101.v12]{20 } @vart[t3101.v13,t3101.v12]{@varn{the same ms. has instead:} 6 } fattened sheep to my table. Then because, without ……, my lord's soldiers overturned my table, I became frightened and my flesh crept.

#etcsl#altGrpo
#etcsl#alt t3101.v10 t3101.v11
#etcsl#alt t3101.v12 t3101.v13
#etcsl#altGrpc

@(29 = 29-34) In the month Ezen-Ninazu, after  @varh[t3101.v14]{the 15th day } @vart[t3101.v15,t3101.v14]{@varn{1 ms. has instead:} five days had passed }, my lord gave me his instructions.  @varh[t3101.v16]{By the first day } @vart[t3101.v17,t3101.v16]{@varn{2 mss. have instead:} after one day had passed } of the month U-bigu, I  @varh[t3101.v18]{sent to you } @vart[t3101.v19,t3101.v18]{@varn{1 ms. has instead:} I sent to my lord …… } a messenger. Now it is  @varh[t3101.v20]{midday } @vart[t3101.v21,t3101.v20]{@varn{1 ms. has instead:} mid-month } @vart[t3101.v22,t3101.v20]{@varn{1 other ms. has instead:} the day did not …… }, …… approached. May my lord know!

